ry/package/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Parcel Tracking"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-2"></span></i><span>Parcel Tracking</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/query/freight/#tabIndex=1" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Solution Inquiry"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-3"></span></i><span>Shipping Solution Inquiry</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/customization/expert-service/?isNeedParams=1" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Expert"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-4"></span></i><span>Shipping Expert</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/customization/fillin/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Customized Logistics"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-5"></span></i><span>Customized Logistics</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/account/consult/before-sale" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shopping Enquiry"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-1-6"></span></i><span>Shopping Enquiry</span></a></li></ul></section></div></div><div class="drop-down special-drop-down customer-nav" data-tag-name="帮助栏"><a href="/#" aria-label="drop-down" class="drop-down-top"><div class="special-tabs"><i class="icon-service"></i><em class="icon-next"></em></div></a><div class="drop-down-bottom dir-right"><section><ul><li><a href="/en/page/help/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Help Center"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-1"></span></i><span>Help Center</span></a></li><li><a href="javascript:void(0);" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Customer Service"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-2"></span></i><span>Customer Service</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/shippinghacks/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Shipping Hacks"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-3"></span></i><span>Shipping Hacks</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/noviceguide/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="User Guidance"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-4"></span></i><span>User Guidance</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/contactus/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Contact Us"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-5"></span></i><span>Contact Us</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/aboutus/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="About Us"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-6"></span></i><span>About Us</span></a></li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div><div class="header-middle"><div class="header-center header-middle-main"><ul class="header-nav"><li class="nav-item home"><a href="/en/page/homepage" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">HOME</a></li><li class="nav-item express"><a href="/en/page/transport/" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">FORWARDING</a></li><li class="nav-item business"><a href="https://www.buckydrop.com/en/?pr=5XFWE&prc=W2V1V&utm_source=superbuy&utm_medium=referral&utm_content=website-navigation" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_blank" class="nav-text">DROPSHIPPING</a></li><li class="nav-item partner"><a href="/en/page/about/affiliate/" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">AFFILIATES</a></li><li class="nav-item pricing"><a href="/en/page/guide/feecomposition" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">PRICING</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ant-spin-nested-loading global-spin"><div class="ant-spin-container"><div class="shop-guide en"><div class="banner"><div class="viewport clearfix"><div class="fl"><h1>Welcome to User Guidance</h1></div><div class="fr r-box"><a href="/en/page/video/index/" class="know-more" target="_blank">Get to Know Superbuy <em></em></a></div></div></div><div class="step1 step"><div class="viewport clearfix viewport-en"><h2>Select Item</h2><div class="cont clearfix mt20"><div class="step-name">Step1</div><div class="l-box fl"><div class="type-1 type">Method 1</div><div class="txt mt15"><span>Choose products from Hong Kong and Chinese ecommerce websites and copy the link of your desired item. For how to choose products from Chinese onine marketplaces, read <a href="https://img.superbuy.com/download/shoppingagent_en.pdf" target="_blank">A Beginner's Guide to Buying from Chinese Online Marketplaces</a>.</span></div><div class="pic mt20"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step1_1.jpg"></div><div class="tips"><div class="tit"><span class="tips">TIPS</span></div><ul class="clearfix"><li>1、Available for Taobao, Tmall, JD, No.1, VIP Shop, Dangdang, Amazon China, 1688 and Hong Kong ecommerce website.</li><li>2、Unable to search items? Try our <a href="/en/page/eptpurchase/" class="a-link" target="_blank">Expert Service</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="r-box fr"><div class="type-2 type">Method 2</div><div class="txt mt15">Search by product name on Superbuy and choose among the results from Taobao, Tmall, and JD.com.</div><div class="pic mt20"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step1_2.jpg"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="step2 step"><div class="viewport clearfix"><h2>Submit Order</h2><div class="cont clearfix mt20"><div class="step-name">Step2</div><div class="l-box fl"><div class="type-1 type">You may</div><div class="txt mt15">Select item's colour, size, and quantity, then add to shopping cart or check out.</div><div class="pic mt20"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step2_1.jpg"></div><div class="tips" style="position: absolute;"><div class="tit"><span class="tips">TIPS</span></div><ul class="clearfix"><li>1、Please be advised that risks will be reminded since some items are restricted for international delivery.</li><li>2、We advise you to understand all risks related to products purchased on 1688. Please refer to Superbuy's 1688 shopping agent notice.</li><li>3、Most of the products from 1688 have minimum order in quantity. Please refer to the minimum order of quantity of the supplier.</li><li>4、For products from Hong Kong e-commerce website, please choose method 2 (i.e. fill in product information to submit your order).</li></ul></div></div><div class="r-box fr"><div class="type-2 type left">or</div><div class="txt mt15">Fill in product information and submit your order (E.g. Shopping agent service of Hong Kong ecommerce websites)</div><div class="attention">Note: Choose Guangdong Warehouse for products from China and Hong Kong warehouse for products from Hong Kong websites.</div><div class="pic mt20"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step2_2.jpg"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="step3 step"><div class="viewport clearfix"><div class="step-name">Step3</div><div class="cont clearfix"><div class="l-box fl"><h2>Pay for Item(s)</h2><div class="txt mt15">Choose payment method and pay for the item and Chinese local delivery fee.</div><div class="tips mt30"><div class="tit"><span class="tips">TIPS</span></div><ul class="clearfix"><li>Available for multiple currencies.</li><li>Payment Methods: Credit Cards, Wechat, Alipay, Chinese Debit Cards, Bank Tele Transfer.</li></ul></div></div><div class="r-box fr"><div class="pic"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step3.jpg"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="step4 step"><div class="viewport clearfix"><div class="step-name">Step4</div><div class="cont clearfix"><div class="l-box"><h2>Superbuy Purchase</h2><div class="txt mt15">Our shopping agents will contact the seller and purchase your ordered items.</div><div class="pic mt10"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step4.jpg"></div><div class="tips mt20"><div class="tit"><span class="tips">TIPS</span></div><ul class="clearfix"><li>During the purchasing process, you can click ‘order enquiry’ to contact our shopping agents for any further details, and they will contact you via email or message if needed, i.e. some information is needed to be completed by you.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="step5 step"><div class="viewport clearfix"><div class="step-name">Step5</div><div class="cont clearfix"><div class="l-box"><h2>Superbuy Inspection and Storage</h2><div class="txt mt15"><span>Quality inspection will be carried out and items will be stored in the warehouse. You can visit ‘User Center’ –‘<a href="/en/page/parcel/storage/" class="a-link" target="_blank">My Warehouse</a>’ to view the item once it is stored.</span></div><div class="pic mt10"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/step5.jpg"></div><div class="tips mt20"><div class="tit"><span class="tips">TIPS</span></div><ul class="clearfix"><li>1、Once the item has arrived to our warehouse, a series of quality inspection will be carried out and the photos will be taken for you to view them. We will contact you immediately if there are any problems.</li><li>2、Products purchased from 1688 has a different set of quality control standard, please refer to <a href="/en/page/help/#p2_71_helpId1048/" class="a-link" target="_blank">Superbuy's Shopping Agent User Manual.</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="important-tip"><div class="viewport"><div class="intro clearfix"><div class="pic fl"><span class="ico"></span></div><dl class="fl"><dt class="mt20">What do you do next?：</dt><dd>1、Send the stored items overseas (Step 6 – 9)，</dd><dd>2、Or purchase more and send them all together (Repeat Step 1-5, then Step 6 -9)</dd><dd class="tips mt10"><div class="clearfix"><div class="ico fl"><span class="tip-ico">TIPS</span></div><div class="cont fl ml10"><p>1.We provide 90 days free storage service for your items.</p><p>2.Stock up and consolidate them to ship overseas in order to save shipping fee.</p></div></div></dd></dl></div><div class="business-des mt20"><a class="more"><a href="/en/page/notice/?id=101" target="_blank">Learn More</a></a><dl><dt>Description of International Delivery Service：</dt><dd>1. We can deliver your items to over 200 countries and regions worldwide with various delivery methods.</dd><dd>2. International delivery service is operated by our designated third party. Unfortunately, we are unable to fully control the processed time, item restrictions, custom tax, etc. However, we will try our best to assist you for any issues happened during delivery.</dd></dl></div></div></div><ul class="wrap"><li><div><div class="content"><h2>Submit for Delivery</h2><p class="text">Visit ‘My Warehouse’ and select items then submit for delivery. Fill in delivery details and choose the recommended type of delivery.</p><em class="step">Step6</em><img alt="step05" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/guide/transportagent/step05_en.jpg" class="other step05"><div class="tips"><h3>Tips</h3><p>1.Some items may be restricted with a certain type of delivery. However, we have selected a few recommended types of delivery for you to choose from the list.</p><p>2.We provide additional services such as package removal, package reinforcement, insurance, etc. Please inform us under remark and we will follow your request.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div><div class="content"><h2>Pay international shipping fee deposit</h2><p class="text">Select payment method for the international shipping fee deposit and customs fee.</p><em class="step">Step7</em><img alt="step06" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/guide/transportagent/step06_en.jpg" class="other step06"><div class="tips"><h3>Tips</h3><p>1. The international shipping fee deposit is calculated according to the product's estimated weight, the selected shipment method, and the destination.</p><p>2. The final shipping fee will be calculated according to the package size and weight verified by the shipping company. If there is a discrepancy between the final shipping fee and the deposit, the amount of difference will be returned to your Superbuy account after the product is shipped</p></div></div></div></li><li><div><div class="content"><h2>Superbuy Delivery</h2><p class="text">Consolidate and pack items, reinforce package, weight and send out for delivery.</p><em class="step">Step8</em><img alt="step07" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/guide/transportagent/step07_en.jpg" class="other step07"><div class="tips"><h3>Tips</h3><p>You can track the parcel via ‘User Center’ – ‘My Parcel’ after it is sent out.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div><div class="content"><h2>Waiting for your package to arrive</h2><p class="text">You can track your package and follow its shipping progress on the “My Parcel” page.</p><em class="step">Step9</em><img alt="step08" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/guide/transportagent/step08_en.jpg" class="other step08"><div class="tips"><h3>Tips</h3><p>There is always the possibility that accidents may happen during international package shipments. Such circumstances include delays, confiscation, taxes, package damage, missing packages and more. Superbuy cannot control or prevent accidents that may happen when your package is in the hands of a third-party logistics company or the customs, nor will we be able to guarantee the service quality of other companies not affiliated to Superbuy. However, we aim to provide the best service possible to our customers and will inform you beforehand of the shipping situation for each shipping route or country you select and do everything we can to aid you if problems occur.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div><div class="content last"><h2>Delivered & Review</h2><p class="text">Once you have received the parcel, you can confirm the delivery via‘User Center’ – ‘My Parcel’. If you have any question regarding to the parcel, you can also choose the relevant parcel and apply for after-sales service.</p><em class="step">Final Step</em><img alt="step09_2" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/guide/transportagent/step09_2_en.jpg" class="other step09_2"><div class="tips"><h3>Tips</h3><p>Once you completed the review, credit will be earned. Don't forget to earn credit as it can be used to deduct the international delivery fee.</p></div></div></div></li></ul><div class="foot-banner-box"><div class="viewport"><div class="tit">Download Superbuy APP</div><div class="tip">Download now and enjoy better shopping results than shop on your own.</div><div class="wechat"><img alt="QRcode-download-spuperbuy-app" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/en/source/img/guide/shoppingagent/wechat.png"></div><ul class="download-btn clearfix"><li class="mt20" style="margin-top: 20px;"><a href="https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/id943334345?mt=8" class="ios-btn btn" target="_blank"><div class="s-name">Download on the</div><div class="b-name">App Store</div></a></li><li class="mt30" style="margin-top: 30px;"><a href="https://m.superbuy.com/en/download/" class="android-btn btn" target="_blank"><div class="s-name">Available on the android</div><div class="b-name">App Store</div></a></li></ul></div><div class="foot-link"><div class="viewport"><ul class="ul clearfix"><li><a href="/en/page/shopguidelines/" aria-label="go-shopguidelines" target="_blank">App Guidance</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/help/#p0_14_helpId19" aria-label="go-helpcenter" target="_blank">Superbuy Tutorial</a></li><li style="display: none;"><a href="" aria-label="go-helpcenter" target="_blank">Shopping Agent Tutorial</a></li><li class="go-shop"><a href="//www.superbuy.com/en/page/shoppingagent/" aria-label="go-shoppingagent" target="_blank">Shop Now<em></em></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><aside class="m-tool-bar m-tool-bar-en tool-bar-show"><section class="beijing-time-bar"><p>UTC+8</p><p c